give @s minecraft:written_book{title:"Von Carstein Invitation",author:"Mannfred von Carstein",pages:['{"text": "I am Mannfred von Carstein. Sylvania is not a forest with a rumor. It is a county that voted for the grave."}','{"text": "The living bar their gates at dusk. The dead do not. Iron’s blood and death magics are how my court speaks. Malum is the slower occult — useful, not polite."}','{"text": "Job: walk my fens after dark. Kill what walks. Or bring me a living captain and kneel. Either is a province won."}','{"text": "Diplomacy: Ally me and Heartland towns will learn your name the wrong way. Enemy me and come at dawn with Recruits and a siege engine. Tribute is blood or bodies. Choose before the moon is up."}']} 1
scoreboard players add @s rallous.vampire 1
advancement grant @s only rallous_old_world:lords/mannfred
